+// The panel beside the buttons shows the Town Map (once the player has it),
+// or the Pokétch (the DS's lower screen, running underneath all along):
+// MAP and POKéTCH choose, and a tap on the map (or MAP with the map shown)
+// opens the Town Map app. The port draws the map from the Town Map's own
+// pictures, laid out as the game tells it (nitro_port_lowermenu.h): the
